;; Start Sparky Dave in the All-Stars look: the second icon in the drawer runs this, as the first
;; runs SparkyDave (the NES look). It is the SparkyDave launcher with allstars, so everything else
;; is the same, and the launcher's other words still work:
;;
;;   execute SparkyDave-AllStars             the build for this machine's video standard
;;   execute SparkyDave-AllStars pal debug   as SparkyDave allstars pal debug
;;
;; Run it from the drawer it is in, as SparkyDave (a double-click from Workbench does).
.KEY first,second
.BRA {
.KET }
.DEF first ""
.DEF second ""

execute SparkyDave allstars {first} {second}
